# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
# key.properties and the debug.keystore below ARE committed on purpose:
# they hold a standard Android debug key (password "android") used to sign
# CI release builds so artifacts install directly. Never commit a real key.
!key.properties
!app/debug.keystore
**/*.jks
